Do[ you] want[ to] get[ better] at making[ delicious] BBQ? You[ will] have the opportunity, put this on your calendar now. Thursday, September 22nd join World[ Class] BBQ Champion, Tony Bal[ay] from Lonestar Smoke Rangers. He[ will] be teaching[ a beginner level class] for everyone who wants[ to] get[ better] with their culinary[ skills].
